<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42673" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑρπύζω</span></b> , impf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἵρπυζον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					13.93
				</span></i>
			 : pres. only in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>: aor. 1
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑρπύσαι</span> in 
				Att.
			 (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕρπω</span>):—<i>creep, crawl,</i> in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> always of persons weighed down by age or deep distress, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑρπύζοντ᾽ ἀνὰ γουνόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					1.193
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑρπύζων παρὰ θῖνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					13.220
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.225
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1289
			</span></i> ; of quadrupeds and children, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				542
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρόνος ἑρπύζων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.19
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Jul.
			</span></i>); of ivy, ib.<i><span class="en">
				7.22
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Simm.
			</span></i> Theb.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
